# Saved stabilisation tuning (ligmax_gui/tuning.py). Bench-tuned numbers for one
# particular boat, not source: committing them would put one flight controller's
# gains in every checkout, and a pull would overwrite whatever the last session
# measured. Back it up with the rest of the ground station's state.
tuning-profiles.json
tuning-profiles.json.tmp

# Saved /led_control effects (ligmax_gui/lights_effects.py). Same reasoning:
# these are authored patterns from one session, not source.
#
# Note what is NOT ignored: ligmax_gui/light-effects-examples.json, the bundled
# examples. Those are source - generated by tools/gen_light_effects.py, the same
# in every checkout, never written at runtime. Keep this pattern exact rather
# than widening it to light-effects*.json, which would drop them.
light-effects.json
light-effects.json.tmp
